      "name": "Wraith Walk",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The Deathcharger and its rider magically enter the Ethereal Plane from the Material Plane, or vice versa.\n\nGreater Steed Variant: Deathknights can summon a deathcharger via the find greater steed spell. When a deathcharger is summoned through the spell it loses the extra attack from {b <em>trampleing charge</em>} when a target is prone, also its <strong><em>wraith walk</em></strong> ability can only be used 3 times per long rest and only lasts until the start of its next turn.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
